Prompt 👇

Create a close-up hyper-realistic portrait of a girl in the style of a glamorous photoshoot. The face and upper shoulders are in focus, the background is dark, blurred, and does not distract from the model.

Appearance features:

Long, very voluminous wavy hair, looks slightly wet, strands fall carelessly on the face and shoulders, creating a sense of naturalness and slight negligence;

Skin is glowing, with a light natural shine, as if illuminated from within, with a pronounced texture and highlights on the cheekbones, neck and shoulders;

Expressive eyes with smoky makeup in dark turquoise and black shades, clearly defined arrows, voluminous eyelashes;

Eyebrows are neatly laid, of a natural shade, emphasize the expressiveness of the look;

Lips are plump, covered with a glossy lipstick of a soft pink shade, slightly open, create an effect of sensuality.

Lighting:

Dramatic, with contrasting shadows and bright highlights on the skin and hair;

The main light source is directed from the front and slightly from above, emphasizing the relief of the face and neck;

Additional highlights on the wet strands of hair and skin, creating an effect of freshness and depth.

Details:

The composition of the portrait is slightly shifted, the face is not in the center of the frame, which adds dynamics and artistic expressiveness;

Shoulders and upper chest are bare, emphasizing natural beauty and elegance of lines;

Emphasis on the play of light and shadow, creating the volume and depth of the image.

Style:

High detail, realism at the level of professional photography;

Cinematic effect, with an emphasis on artistry and aesthetics;

A color palette with a predominance of warm and deep tones, contrasting with cold smoky eye makeup.

Image quality: 8K, maximum clarity and detail. Massive dark turquoise earrings in the ears. Black thick torn eyelashes.

